":299939,"user_name":"景南鑫 Rock.J","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2313071,"ip_address":"","ucode":"C611E784D391F5","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/23/4b/6f/50be543b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1624929615,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"讲的比较泛，教练有几个核心工作，根据自有情况制定目标，用好球员，提升球员。另外聊了绩效，技术团队的绩效一直是所有企业的难题。我认为团队氛围相比绩效更重要，如何建立良好的氛围，价值观非常重要的\n","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":251240,"user_name":"Sam_Deep_Thinking","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1001152,"ip_address":"","ucode":"8E4EF6F24B821B","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/46/c0/106d98e7.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1601433401,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"很好的文章，读了三次了，感谢作者。","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":15955,"user_name":"ヾ(◍°∇°◍)ﾉﾞ","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1044175,"ip_address":"","ucode":"89545632BDA56E","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJOBwR7MCVqwZbPA5RQ2mjUjd571jUXUcBCE7lY5vSMibWn8D5S4PzDZMaAhRPdnRBqYbVOBTJibhJg/132","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1531696216,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"是的，基本上80%以上的“管理者”是卡位的，不是发光发热的，公司功劳其实是员工，害死公司的才是这些人，而事实上却是相反的","like_count":1},{"had_liked":false,"id":202198,"user_name":"远古的咖啡","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1104996,"ip_address":"","ucode":"D86D6C236089EC","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/dc/64/5b4a066b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1585921779,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"管理者要保证自身能力过硬，需要有判断力、洞察力、决断力、领导力，体育教练的比喻挺有意思。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":52680,"user_name":"一木成舟🌊","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1315344,"ip_address":"","ucode":"610EA312D3AAFE","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/14/12/10/8ef02bff.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1545474139,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"作为一个教练，整体把控，及时沟通，以及要培训的合适人员。不要想着都顾及","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":39524,"user_name":"Kery","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1002341,"ip_address":"","ucode":"0479E9A5F11C73","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/4b/65/91540892.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1542295293,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"方向错了，做的越多，错的就越离谱。作为一个技术领导者，为团队指对方向最重要。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":34080,"user_name":"修文","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1262357,"ip_address":"","ucode":"820A169D0ABBCB","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/43/15/3c87f359.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1539993490,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"非常欣赏一个好的Leader应该像优秀球队教练（不断自我挑战）一样的比喻","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":26515,"user_name":"白杨","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1103549,"ip_address":"","ucode":"5AD782110E50E7","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/d6/bd/36e60787.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1537628948,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":3,"product_id":100006201,"comment_content":"是的，基层的技术领导者，如果不关心细节的话，作为下属，你根本不知道他是来干啥的。。。\n\n但这样也太累了。还是相信人，使用能够自我自驱动的人","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":11987,"user_name":"小Q","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1090324,"ip_address":"","ucode":"11F0764F4534B8","user_header":"http://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfT